  "title": "Procurement Policy Note 10/21 – Thresholds and Inclusion of VAT",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/procurement-policy-note-0921-thresholds-and-inclusion-of-vat",
  "description": "This note provides the new threshold values for the Public Contracts Regulations and sets out a change for estimating contract values to be inclusive of VAT.",
